@baseUrl = http://device-hostname-or-address:5285
@apiKey = replace-with-protected-api-key

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Dashboard snapshot, allowed LAN only
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/snapshot

### Intake: list current proposals
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake

### Intake: paste a source (URL, repo, or direct SKILL.md-style link)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/source
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/*"
}

### Intake: paste a skill (absolute path, HTTPS SKILL.md URL, or install command text)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/skill
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "/absolute/path/to/SKILL.md"
}

### Intake: paste an MCP endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "https://mcp.example.com/mcp"
}

### Intake: approve a proposal held in review
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/replace-with-proposal-id/approve

### Intake: retry a failed proposal
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/replace-with-proposal-id/retry

### Intake: disable an active proposal and remove its registry record
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/replace-with-proposal-id/disable

### Intake: refresh an active proposal
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/replace-with-proposal-id/refresh

### Intake: delete a proposal
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/intake/replace-with-proposal-id

### Add an authoritative source directly (older schema-based endpoint, still functional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/sources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pattern": "https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/*",
  "enabled": true
}

### Add an explicit local-file skill directly (older schema-based endpoint, still functional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "example",
  "path": "/absolute/path/to/SKILL.md",
  "description": "Example local skill",
  "enabled": true
}

### Add an HTTPS skill directly (older schema-based endpoint, still functional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "remote-example",
  "path": "https://example.com/SKILL.md",
  "description": "Example remote skill",
  "enabled": true
}

### Add and probe a Streamable HTTP MCP server directly (older schema-based endpoint, still functional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/mcp-servers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "example",
  "endpoint": "https://mcp.example.com/mcp"
}

### Clear response cache
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/api/cache

### List advertised OpenAI models
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
